<title>USA: Acmat buys 25 pct of own stock from AIG.</title>
<headline>Acmat buys 25 pct of own stock from AIG.</headline>
<dateline>NEW BRITAIN, Conn. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acmat Corp said Wednesday it has purchased 1,099,996 shares of its own class A common stock from American International Group Inc .</p>
<p>The purchase, said the company, represents about 25 percent of Acmat's outstanding stock, and consisted of 649,996 shares at $14.50 each and 450,000 shares at $15 each.</p>
<p>Payment consisted of $4,174,942 in cash and promissary notes of $12 million payable over eight years with interest at prime rate 8.25 percent floating.</p>
